{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20261NmnbqGcP41795361103.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>赤柱豪宅項目ONE STANLEY，早前被屋宇署指有單位鋼筋與圖則不符，發展商建灝本月初報警，指遭人勒索。</p><p></p><p>ONE STANLEY發展商建灝發言人確認，公司於11月4日就被勒索報警，案件目前已交警方處理，不會評論。</p><p></p><p>據了解，報案人是建灝地產集團，案件涉及一名人士向建灝勒索數千萬元，稱會向外界披露，其認為可能對建灝產生負面影響的資料。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T16:26:34.709271+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":167,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T15:12:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T00:17:38.621777+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T16:19:55.670576+00:00","content_hash":"21b4d9176c5dd6ae5002e04bccb54d06874c874fdc763259bc84fc026c484d08","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}